      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This is a duplicate of a ticket I rose as soon as it started happening, but I can't find the ticket because Canny's search feature is so useless. :(\n\nYou can reproduce it without a trail renderer as well. I had it happen with an avatar with a single mesh renderer with a single vertex.\n\nThere's also this report from 2018:\nhttps://vrchat.canny.io/bug-reports/p/snail-marker-counts-as-avatar-bounds",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
